00:16:35,169 --> 00:16:38,256
Fine, so move aside
so she can explain herself.

253
00:16:38,339 --> 00:16:40,007
I don't care.
Don't you dare film her.

254
00:16:40,091 --> 00:16:41,509
I'll sue every single one of you.

255
00:16:41,592 --> 00:16:42,844
- Move aside.
- Film her.

256
00:16:42,927 --> 00:16:44,762
- Move!
- Show us your face!

257
00:16:45,596 --> 00:16:47,056
I said, stop!

258
00:16:47,598 --> 00:16:49,183
- What?
- What was that?

259
00:16:49,267 --> 00:16:50,518
Get lost, you stalker.

260
00:17:37,273 --> 00:17:38,483
Stop immediately.

261
00:17:39,233 --> 00:17:41,068
Otherwise, I will see you
at the police station.

262
00:17:45,364 --> 00:17:46,365
Let's go.

263
00:17:48,659 --> 00:17:50,536
FIRE THE STALKER FAN IMMEDIATELY

264
00:18:00,838 --> 00:18:02,423
- Move back.
- Please step back.

265
00:18:02,507 --> 00:18:03,591
Please move.

266
00:18:09,639 --> 00:18:10,932
Are you all right?

267
00:18:13,351 --> 00:18:15,394
- Yes.
- Mr. Kang.

268
00:18:17,355 --> 00:18:18,731
So...

269
00:18:19,941 --> 00:18:21,901
About Ms. Da-reum's resignation.

270
00:18:22,944 --> 00:18:24,695
Do you plan to actually process it?

271
00:18:28,074 --> 00:18:30,993
Ask our attorney to come in.

272
00:18:33,996 --> 00:18:35,081
Sure, Mr. Kang.

273
00:18:39,961 --> 00:18:41,546
I just want to go home.

274
00:18:41,629 --> 00:18:43,673
Hey, don't be so weak.

275
00:18:43,756 --> 00:18:46,259
Woman,
we didn't bring you up like this.

276
00:18:46,717 --> 00:18:48,678
I just want to be alone today.

277
00:18:48,761 --> 00:18:50,888
And all you'll do
is mope on the floor.

278
00:18:51,347 --> 00:18:53,766
You have to party on a day like this.

279
00:18:54,141 --> 00:18:56,018
Party? What kind of party?

280
00:18:56,102 --> 00:18:57,728
Ta-da.

281
00:18:59,230 --> 00:19:00,940
A binge-eating party.

282
00:19:02,358 --> 00:19:04,360
Just clear your mind and eat today.

283
00:19:04,443 --> 00:19:05,861
- Thanks.
- Thank you.

284
00:19:05,945 --> 00:19:07,863
- I'll pay with this.
- Thank you.

285
00:19:07,947 --> 00:19:09,156
Sure.

286
00:19:11,033 --> 00:19:12,493
Let's go.

287
00:19:15,788 --> 00:19:17,790
You have something... Never mind.

288
00:19:18,666 --> 00:19:20,084
- That'll be 21,500 won.
- Okay.

289
00:19:21,794 --> 00:19:24,005
- Thank you.
- Enjoy.

290
00:19:26,424 --> 00:19:27,550
- What are you doing?
- What?

291
00:19:27,633 --> 00:19:29,343
- Are you coming in?
- I am.

292
00:19:32,972 --> 00:19:34,098
They're not him.

293
00:19:42,982 --> 00:19:44,025
VISITOR

294
00:20:00,625 --> 00:20:01,917
All right.

295
00:20:02,335 --> 00:20:04,003
I look perfect, as always.

296
00:20:10,801 --> 00:20:13,137
Come quickly, Attorney Kim Min-woo.

297
00:20:13,679 --> 00:20:14,680
Yes, coming.

298
00:20:19,602 --> 00:20:20,811
{\an8}CELEBRITY BULLETIN BOARD

299
00:20:20,895 --> 00:20:23,314
{\an8}"More funeral wreaths
arriving at Appello."

300
00:20:23,564 --> 00:20:25,650
Jeez. It's a whole mess.

301
00:20:26,025 --> 00:20:29,737
Because of Chan's big scandal
I couldn't even go to Pilates.

302
00:20:29,820 --> 00:20:32,156
He's never helpful.

303
00:20:32,865 --> 00:20:33,991
As our attorney

304
00:20:35,034 --> 00:20:36,077
what's the solution?

305
00:20:37,286 --> 00:20:38,996
When it comes to risk control

306
00:20:40,122 --> 00:20:42,083
it would be the fastest
to process her resignation.

307
00:20:47,171 --> 00:20:49,298
But if you wish to keep her on board

308
00:20:49,382 --> 00:20:50,424
sue the hate comments for defamation

309
00:20:50,508 --> 00:20:52,051
under the Information and
Communications Network Act

310
00:20:52,134 --> 00:20:54,595
and the illegal protesters
for obstruction of business

311
00:20:54,679 --> 00:20:56,097
under Article 314
of the Criminal Act.

312
00:20:58,683 --> 00:20:59,975
We may win legally

313
00:21:00,643 --> 00:21:02,895
but public opinion
against Appello could worsen, right?

314
00:21:04,146 --> 00:21:05,189
Probably.

315
00:21:12,321 --> 00:21:14,907
- We got lots of clams for the pasta.
- Yes.

316
00:21:15,116 --> 00:21:16,867
These all look great today.

317
00:21:16,951 --> 00:21:18,077
- Right?
- Yes.

318
00:21:24,834 --> 00:21:26,585
- Hey, did you see him?
- Yes.

319
00:21:26,669 --> 00:21:30,256
Her CEO took her in his arms
and got egged instead.

320
00:21:30,339 --> 00:21:31,632
"Stop immediately."

321
00:21:32,133 --> 00:21:33,384
That was so cool.

322
00:21:33,467 --> 00:21:35,803
- Even my heart skipped a beat.
- Tell me about it.

323
00:21:43,436 --> 00:21:44,478
Hey.

324
00:21:45,396 --> 00:21:46,772
Focus on eating.

325
00:21:46,856 --> 00:21:48,065
No other thoughts allowed.

326
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:54,321
Do you two also think

327
00:21:55,030 --> 00:21:56,031
I am

328
00:21:57,283 --> 00:21:58,701
a stalker fan?

329
00:22:01,912 --> 00:22:04,457
- Namda.
- I am a fan.

330
00:22:06,459 --> 00:22:08,335
And I did get a job at his company.

331
00:22:10,921 --> 00:22:13,299
Anyone can see
that this is premeditated.

332
00:22:14,300 --> 00:22:16,510
Mr. Kang probably
thinks of me that way too.

333
00:22:17,136 --> 00:22:19,180
- Hey.
- I mean

334
00:22:19,555 --> 00:22:21,515
everyone calls me a stalker fan.

335
00:22:22,141 --> 00:22:24,810
It feels like all those years
I've spent as a fan

336
00:22:24,894 --> 00:22:26,479
have been tainted too.

337
00:22:26,562 --> 00:22:27,855
Come on.

338
00:22:27,938 --> 00:22:29,231
Who cares what others say?

339
00:22:30,274 --> 00:22:31,942
You're not like that.

340
00:22:32,151 --> 00:22:33,652
I mean, if that's the case

341
00:22:33,736 --> 00:22:35,529
are fans not allowed to get a job?

342
00:22:36,363 --> 00:22:38,991
She worked hard
to get a job at a place she wanted.

343
00:22:39,074 --> 00:22:42,286
How is that a crime?

344
00:23:05,351 --> 00:23:07,269
CELEBRITY FORUM

345
00:23:07,353 --> 00:23:08,354
What is this?

346
00:23:13,067 --> 00:23:15,528
KINDA BLURRED BUT GOT A SHOT OF HER

347
00:23:15,611 --> 00:23:16,821
ACCESS DENIED:
THIS POST HAS BEEN REPORTED

348
00:23:18,989 --> 00:23:19,990
CAME TO APPELLO AND SAW THE GIRL

349
00:23:20,074 --> 00:23:21,242
ACCESS DENIED:
THIS POST HAS BEEN REPORTED

350
00:23:24,662 --> 00:23:25,913
What a relief.

351
00:23:27,206 --> 00:23:29,917
But who reported these posts?

352
00:23:34,755 --> 00:23:37,424
Gosh. It's been so long
since I've worked that hard.

353
00:23:37,967 --> 00:23:39,134
Great work.

354
00:23:39,927 --> 00:23:41,011
Anyway...

355
00:23:42,221 --> 00:23:44,014
Do you have to go this far?

356
00:23:45,182 --> 00:23:46,267
What?

357
00:23:46,350 --> 00:23:49,019
Must you take everyone down
so mercilessly?

358
00:23:55,568 --> 00:23:56,610
Hey.

359
00:23:58,863 --> 00:24:00,155
Jeez.

360
00:24:12,084 --> 00:24:13,294
Why, you...

361
00:24:13,794 --> 00:24:16,338
Do you know what we had
to go through because of you?

362
00:24:18,924 --> 00:24:19,925
We need to talk.

363
00:24:24,305 --> 00:24:25,723
I'll talk to you later.

364
00:24:40,237 --> 00:24:41,322
What about Da-reum?

365
00:24:47,119 --> 00:24:48,120
"Da-reum"?

366
00:24:49,747 --> 00:24:51,916
So you'll stop pretending
in front of me now?

367
00:24:55,044 --> 00:24:56,545
Was she okay at work today?

368
00:24:56,629 --> 00:24:58,881
Where's your responsibility
as the company's director?

369
00:24:58,964 --> 00:25:00,424
Look at what it has come to.

370
00:25:03,135 --> 00:25:05,930
I'm sorry.
A correction will be issued soon.

371
00:25:07,973 --> 00:25:09,683
Do you think saying sorry is enough?

372
00:25:13,520 --> 00:25:15,481
What about the hundreds of people
at Appello?

373
00:25:16,982 --> 00:25:18,359
Have you thought of them?

374
00:25:18,442 --> 00:25:19,693
Da-reum and I...

375
00:25:22,279 --> 00:25:23,572
aren't dating.

376
00:25:23,948 --> 00:25:25,449
And she's not a stalker fan.

377
00:25:26,325 --> 00:25:28,035
I didn't want you to misunderstand.

378
00:25:28,118 --> 00:25:30,037
You've already
blown this way out of proportion.

379
00:25:31,288 --> 00:25:34,500
The company lost its trust,
and Da-reum got publicly humiliated.

380
00:25:34,708 --> 00:25:36,835
She's now branded
and suffering from insults.

381
00:25:40,506 --> 00:25:41,548
At the very least

382
00:25:43,175 --> 00:25:44,843
you should've told me.

383
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,641
What about you?

384
00:25:52,768 --> 00:25:54,103
Do you tell me everything?

385
00:26:00,442 --> 00:26:01,986
I heard about your mother's accident

386
00:26:02,736 --> 00:26:04,154
from another person.

387
00:26:07,074 --> 00:26:08,242
What about Jeong-yeon?

388
00:26:10,661 --> 00:26:13,789
Were you honest when I asked
how you felt about Da-reum?

389
00:26:15,958 --> 00:26:16,959
Hey.

390
00:26:20,504 --> 00:26:22,214
Do you even think of me as a friend?

391
00:26:32,808 --> 00:26:34,852
If investors keep pressuring you,
I'll step down.

392
00:26:35,769 --> 00:26:37,021
I'll take responsibility.

393
00:26:42,443 --> 00:26:43,444
"Responsibility"?

394
00:26:44,820 --> 00:26:46,363
Then put out this fire
you've started.

395
00:26:50,868 --> 00:26:52,494
Boycott Appello!

396
00:26:52,578 --> 00:26:54,204
- Boycott Appello!
- Boycott Appello!

397
00:26:54,288 --> 00:26:55,789
Kick out the obsessive fan!

398
00:26:55,873 --> 00:26:57,416
- Kick her out!
- Kick her out!

399
00:26:57,499 --> 00:26:59,334
Boycott Appello!

400
00:26:59,418 --> 00:27:01,086
- Boycott Appello!
- Boycott Appello!

401
00:27:01,712 --> 00:27:05,841
I mean, is Director Lee Chan
even thinking right now?

402
00:27:05,924 --> 00:27:07,926
SE Corporation is
advertising to the world

403
00:27:08,010 --> 00:27:09,595
that they're opening
their fashion platform soon.

404
00:27:09,678 --> 00:27:11,555
How can he cause
a boycott at this time?

405
00:27:11,638 --> 00:27:12,890
Yes, we're aware.

406
00:27:12,973 --> 00:27:14,725
I understand your anxiety
as investors

407
00:27:14,808 --> 00:27:16,101
but give us a little more time.

408
00:27:16,185 --> 00:27:18,103
After the correction report,
things are dying down...

409
00:27:18,187 --> 00:27:19,563
What are you talking about?

410
00:27:19,646 --> 00:27:21,023
They're making a scene out there!

411
00:27:21,106 --> 00:27:23,484
How can the company's value falter
just because of one employee?

412
00:27:23,567 --> 00:27:26,737
Yes, realistically speaking,
if she's our risk at the moment

413
00:27:26,820 --> 00:27:28,072
they must get rid of her.

414
00:27:28,155 --> 00:27:29,615
- Fire her.
- Do that.

415
00:27:29,698 --> 00:27:31,950
Are you asking us
to give in to the public sentiment

416
00:27:33,160 --> 00:27:35,037
even though
the allegations weren't factual?

417
00:27:35,120 --> 00:27:36,497
Don't you know
the words "emotional damage"?

418
00:27:36,580 --> 00:27:39,625
When consumers don't like something,
you must always grovel.

419
00:27:39,708 --> 00:27:41,460
Grovel? That is so wrong.

420
00:27:41,543 --> 00:27:42,920
We released a correction report.

421
00:27:43,003 --> 00:27:44,463
Now, settle down.

422
00:27:44,546 --> 00:27:47,007
- People are boycotting you.
- That's not it.

423
00:27:49,676 --> 00:27:51,136
That'll settle this for now.

424
00:27:52,304 --> 00:27:53,472
And then what?

425
00:27:53,764 --> 00:27:55,015
- Fire her!
- Fire her!

426
00:27:55,099 --> 00:27:56,767
Fire the stalker fan!

427
00:27:56,850 --> 00:27:58,393
- Fire her!
- Fire her!

428
00:27:58,477 --> 00:28:00,145
Boycott Appello!

429
00:28:00,729 --> 00:28:02,815
Then we will be shaken
whenever something like this happens

430
00:28:03,482 --> 00:28:05,109
and even abandon
someone important to us.

431
00:28:05,192 --> 00:28:06,360
Mr. Kang.

432
00:28:06,443 --> 00:28:08,695
This isn't the time
to discuss your idealism.

433
00:28:08,779 --> 00:28:10,030
I am talking about standards.

434
00:28:10,989 --> 00:28:13,951
Ms. Nam is a competent employee
who performed well during her time.

435
00:28:14,493 --> 00:28:17,830
Shouldn't we see this as a management
issue, not an individual one?

436
00:28:18,539 --> 00:28:20,207
- What now?
- How can he say that?

437
00:28:21,291 --> 00:28:22,668
No matter what the decision is

438
00:28:23,669 --> 00:28:24,795
I will take responsibility.

439
00:28:25,879 --> 00:28:27,256
- Responsibility?
- He will?

440
00:28:28,340 --> 00:28:29,967
I am the one leading Appello

441
00:28:30,050 --> 00:28:31,802
and I've already proven it
with our performances.

442
00:28:32,761 --> 00:28:33,929
All right.

443
00:28:34,138 --> 00:28:36,473
The opening of SE's platform
will be your testing ground.

444
00:28:37,141 --> 00:28:39,226
We'll see
if you can still keep your position.

445
00:28:42,271 --> 00:28:43,313
I will show you

446
00:28:44,731 --> 00:28:45,732
with the results.

447
00:28:55,534 --> 00:28:56,618
Mr. Kang.

448
00:29:06,295 --> 00:29:07,963
Are you sure about this?

449
00:29:08,422 --> 00:29:09,464
What?

450
00:29:10,340 --> 00:29:13,552
I think I understand
the decision you have made.

451
00:29:15,179 --> 00:29:16,263
Then be my support.

452
00:29:16,763 --> 00:29:17,806
Mr. Kang.

453
00:29:18,891 --> 00:29:22,144
Yes, I will do that
as one of your employees.

454
00:29:23,228 --> 00:29:24,980
But let me say this as a friend.

455
00:29:26,273 --> 00:29:28,150
Ha-gi, if this continues

456
00:29:28,859 --> 00:29:30,652
your position as the CEO
will be in jeopardy.

457
00:29:36,116 --> 00:29:37,743
Let me see the investors off.

458
00:29:56,136 --> 00:29:57,763
There are so many things to do.

459
00:29:58,347 --> 00:30:00,390
I hope
the preparations are going well.

460
00:30:05,312 --> 00:30:06,313
I mean

461
00:30:07,189 --> 00:30:09,274
my absence won't have an impact
on the company as a whole.

462
00:30:16,949 --> 00:30:18,116
MASTER IM CHEONG-RIM

463
00:30:20,953 --> 00:30:22,537
MASTER IM CHEONG-RIM

464
00:30:23,455 --> 00:30:24,915
Hello, Master Im.

465
00:30:25,249 --> 00:30:28,377
Hello, Ms. Nam.
This is Im Cheong-rim calling.

466
00:30:28,460 --> 00:30:30,212
Yes, please speak, ma'am.

467
00:30:30,629 --> 00:30:32,714
How is the preparation going
for the event?

468
00:30:36,176 --> 00:30:40,013
Of course. I was just busy
because of the preparations.

469
00:30:40,347 --> 00:30:41,598
MS. NAM DA-REUM

470
00:30:41,682 --> 00:30:45,060
<i>Have you received
the project proposal and the samples?</i>

471
00:30:45,143 --> 00:30:48,146
Well, it wasn't half bad.

472
00:30:49,106 --> 00:30:51,692
She loves that she gets to do
the event with Lee Chan.

473
00:30:51,775 --> 00:30:52,901
Quiet.

474
00:30:53,443 --> 00:30:55,320
<i>Anyway.</i>

475
00:30:55,404 --> 00:30:58,657
<i>I wanted to share some of my input,
so I sent you an email.</i>

476
00:30:58,740 --> 00:31:02,577
I'll be in Seoul in a few days,
so we'll talk more then.

477
00:31:02,661 --> 00:31:05,497
Right. Yes, I'll check my email.

478
00:31:05,747 --> 00:31:08,667
Yes. Goodbye.

479
00:31:15,674 --> 00:31:17,009
What do I do?

480
00:31:19,469 --> 00:31:20,679
Get it together, Da-reum.

481
00:31:21,430 --> 00:31:22,556
This is not the time for this.

482
00:31:25,600 --> 00:31:27,185
REVISION REQUEST
FOR APPELLO'S SHOWROOM

483
00:31:27,269 --> 00:31:28,603
I ATTACH MY REVISIONS BELOW
SEE YOU SOON IN SEOUL

484
00:31:35,193 --> 00:31:36,194
Come in.

485
00:31:37,696 --> 00:31:38,697
Mr. Kang.

486
00:31:38,989 --> 00:31:42,117
Master Im must've sent her feedback.

487
00:31:44,161 --> 00:31:47,789
Da-reum put together her requests
and sent them over.

488
00:31:48,165 --> 00:31:49,958
Please check your email.

489
00:31:51,960 --> 00:31:53,420
- Okay.
- All right.

490
00:32:02,179 --> 00:32:03,597
POP-UP REVISIONS, MEETING IN SEOUL

491
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:05,766
THIS IS NAM DA-REUM OF MARKETING

492
00:32:11,188 --> 00:32:13,148
KNOTTING SHOWROOM REVISION REPORT

493
00:32:13,231 --> 00:32:14,691
NAM DA-REUM

494
00:32:18,612 --> 00:32:20,822
TOP VIEW OF THE SHOWROOM
WITH MASTER IM'S REVISION REQUESTS

495
00:32:23,033 --> 00:32:24,326
<i>Let's do this together.</i>

496
00:32:24,576 --> 00:32:26,703
You've got to smile
when things get tough.

497
00:32:26,787 --> 00:32:30,916
Don't you know
smiling actually makes things better?

498
00:32:38,507 --> 00:32:39,591
But Mom.

499
00:32:40,342 --> 00:32:42,302
It's a small company.

500
00:32:43,345 --> 00:32:44,346
I feel...

501
00:32:46,223 --> 00:32:49,059
like I can be of use here.

502
00:32:49,726 --> 00:32:51,895
That's why I like Appello

503
00:32:53,647 --> 00:32:55,524
and I'm happier here.

504
00:32:59,194 --> 00:33:00,278
<i>I don't want to be</i>

505
00:33:01,363 --> 00:33:02,948
<i>a nuisance to the company.</i>

506
00:33:19,172 --> 00:33:21,299
CEO KANG HA-GI

507
00:34:01,673 --> 00:34:05,135
The office feels so empty
without Da-reum.

508
00:34:05,469 --> 00:34:07,345
She always spread
positive energy at work.

509
00:34:08,763 --> 00:34:10,015
I know.

510
00:34:11,391 --> 00:34:13,977
I really miss Da-reum.

511
00:34:14,811 --> 00:34:18,064
She looked like she was barely
eating these days.

512
00:34:19,316 --> 00:34:21,693
I wonder if she's going to be okay.

513
00:34:22,152 --> 00:34:24,196
We have to worry
about the event first.

514
