the concept store

779
00:57:09,679 --> 00:57:11,014
he recruited me.

780
00:57:11,556 --> 00:57:13,934
At the time, I was working
at a fashion company.

781
00:57:16,812 --> 00:57:18,563
I can't say

782
00:57:19,314 --> 00:57:20,899
I didn't have
any other motives at first.

783
00:57:21,608 --> 00:57:26,905
Working with the star we admire
feels surreal to us.

784
00:57:28,156 --> 00:57:31,868
His success feels like my success.

785
00:57:33,495 --> 00:57:36,748
But over time, I realized

786
00:57:37,791 --> 00:57:39,793
what really matters is...

787
00:57:40,710 --> 00:57:42,295
who I am.

788
00:57:43,880 --> 00:57:46,550
It's about what I find fun

789
00:57:47,092 --> 00:57:49,636
and what I want to be good at.

790
00:57:50,262 --> 00:57:51,930
I'm sure

791
00:57:52,848 --> 00:57:55,016
you had the same concerns.

792
00:57:58,979 --> 00:58:00,564
Speaking of which

793
00:58:02,482 --> 00:58:04,150
you should come back to work.

794
00:58:04,401 --> 00:58:07,112
Why would you run away
when you didn't do anything wrong?

795
00:58:07,195 --> 00:58:10,323
You're the most passionate,
and you work harder than anyone else.

796
00:58:11,032 --> 00:58:12,033
Everyone is

797
00:58:13,285 --> 00:58:15,537
waiting for you.

798
00:58:23,336 --> 00:58:24,337
I wish

799
00:58:25,046 --> 00:58:26,381
I could go back.

800
00:58:28,008 --> 00:58:29,009
But that

801
00:58:29,885 --> 00:58:31,845
would put Mr. Kang in trouble.

802
00:58:34,055 --> 00:58:35,098
Haven't you seen it yet?

803
00:58:36,474 --> 00:58:37,475
Seen what?

804
00:58:38,602 --> 00:58:41,521
Mr. Kang posted
Appello's official statement.

805
00:58:42,731 --> 00:58:43,732
What?

806
00:58:47,110 --> 00:58:50,822
<i>Actually, I'm here
because Mr. Kang asked me.</i>

807
00:58:53,241 --> 00:58:54,451
He asked me to give you this knot.

808
00:58:55,619 --> 00:58:59,748
Do you have any idea
how much he was worried about you?

809
00:59:11,885 --> 00:59:13,428
APPELLO OFFICIAL STATEMENT

810
00:59:14,095 --> 00:59:18,183
<i>Appello has verified the facts
regarding the matter</i>

811
00:59:18,266 --> 00:59:20,352
<i>involving one of our employees.</i>

812
00:59:21,269 --> 00:59:24,731
<i>We confirm that the employee
in question is not a stalker fan.</i>

813
00:59:30,946 --> 00:59:34,074
<i>In fact, the employee in question is
a dedicated and responsible member</i>

814
00:59:34,449 --> 00:59:37,953
<i>who has been faithfully carrying out
her duties at Appello.</i>

815
00:59:52,801 --> 00:59:53,927
<i>And yet</i>

816
00:59:54,386 --> 00:59:56,554
<i>some fans are pressuring
the employee in question to resign</i>

817
00:59:57,013 --> 00:59:59,474
<i>based on claims
that have been found to be false.</i>

818
00:59:59,557 --> 01:00:01,685
- I knew he'd do it.
- See? He's good.

819
01:00:01,893 --> 01:00:03,561
Hey. Be quiet.

820
01:00:04,062 --> 01:00:07,190
<i>Appello will not give in
to any unreasonable demands</i>

821
01:00:07,440 --> 01:00:09,609
<i>nor will we tolerate
any slander or threats</i>

822
01:00:09,859 --> 01:00:11,361
<i>against our employee.</i>

823
01:00:11,695 --> 01:00:13,488
{\an8}APPELLO'S CEO HANDLED THIS WITH CLASS

824
01:00:13,571 --> 01:00:15,281
{\an8}I FEEL BAD FOR THEIR ROOKIE

825
01:00:15,365 --> 01:00:16,658
{\an8}THAT IS WHAT A TRUE LEADER IS

826
01:00:16,741 --> 01:00:18,118
{\an8}GOING ALL IN ON APPELLO STOCKS

827
01:00:21,287 --> 01:00:23,915
<i>The employee in question will</i>

828
01:00:24,874 --> 01:00:26,292
<i>remain a member of Appello</i>

829
01:00:27,460 --> 01:00:28,628
<i>as she has always been.</i>

830
01:01:01,202 --> 01:01:02,245
Ms. Nam.

831
01:01:07,417 --> 01:01:08,626
What brings you here at this hour?

832
01:01:14,007 --> 01:01:15,008
Did you run here?

833
01:01:18,553 --> 01:01:19,637
Yes.

834
01:01:22,098 --> 01:01:23,099
But it's cold.

835
01:01:41,576 --> 01:01:44,079
Mr. Kang. I...

836
01:01:45,121 --> 01:01:46,831
I don't want to quit.

837
01:01:52,796 --> 01:01:54,380
But why? You already submitted
your resignation.

838
01:01:58,468 --> 01:01:59,969
Because of you.

839
01:02:02,514 --> 01:02:04,766
You made me work
even outside the office.

840
01:02:05,725 --> 01:02:07,227
It's unfair.

841
01:02:10,814 --> 01:02:11,940
You said I'd remain

842
01:02:12,774 --> 01:02:13,817
a member of Appello

843
01:02:15,110 --> 01:02:17,153
as I have always been.

844
01:02:22,367 --> 01:02:23,493
I'm sorry...

845
01:02:27,288 --> 01:02:28,498
the official statement took so long.

846
01:02:31,501 --> 01:02:32,794
To repay your trust

847
01:02:33,419 --> 01:02:35,463
I'll dedicate myself to Appello.

848
01:02:40,635 --> 01:02:42,470
Because I'm a CEO

849
01:02:43,847 --> 01:02:45,640
I always have to hold back
before making a decision.

850
01:02:49,102 --> 01:02:50,562
I have to think twice

851
01:02:51,855 --> 01:02:52,897
and hesitate countless times.

852
01:02:55,775 --> 01:02:57,360
I'm not even as brave as you think.

853
01:03:01,364 --> 01:03:02,365
It must've been hard on you...

854
01:03:04,159 --> 01:03:05,243
hasn't it?

855
01:03:08,538 --> 01:03:09,581
No.

856
01:03:10,874 --> 01:03:13,459
I'm sorry.

857
01:03:16,129 --> 01:03:17,172
From now on

858
01:03:18,548 --> 01:03:20,175
I'm not going to hide
my feelings anymore.

859
01:03:20,800 --> 01:03:22,635
I'm going to be honest
about everything.

860
01:03:23,178 --> 01:03:24,929
I don't want to say

861
01:03:25,388 --> 01:03:27,223
that I won't blame you
even if you fire me...

862
01:03:28,892 --> 01:03:30,018
or that I'm okay.

863
01:03:32,604 --> 01:03:33,771
I missed Appello.

864
01:03:34,814 --> 01:03:37,650
I missed my job.

865
01:03:41,029 --> 01:03:42,071
And...

866
01:03:44,365 --> 01:03:45,617
what's more...

867
01:03:53,208 --> 01:03:56,002
I missed you.

868
01:04:04,093 --> 01:04:05,303
I think...

869
01:04:07,388 --> 01:04:08,556
I...

870
01:04:10,141 --> 01:04:13,228
like you, Mr. Kang.

871
01:05:20,920 --> 01:05:24,632
{\an8}MY BIAS, MY BOSS

872
01:05:35,560 --> 01:05:39,605
{\an8}"Making money by being a stalker fan.
What an easy life."

873
01:05:41,524 --> 01:05:43,192
Hey. How about this?

874
01:05:44,277 --> 01:05:47,530
It breaches both the Network Act
and criminal law.

875
01:05:47,613 --> 01:05:48,865
Request a takedown first.

876
01:05:48,948 --> 01:05:51,075
We need a warrant
to identify the person.

877
01:05:52,076 --> 01:05:54,203
Taking screenshots of everything.

878
01:05:54,287 --> 01:05:55,830
Good.

879
01:05:55,913 --> 01:05:58,833
Now we send
the notice to the platforms

880
01:05:58,916 --> 01:06:01,085
then the posts
will be deleted tonight.

881
01:06:01,169 --> 01:06:02,253
Okay.

882
01:06:02,837 --> 01:06:06,132
"The company must go down
for hiring a stalker."

883
01:06:07,342 --> 01:06:09,510
Screenshot that too.

884
01:06:11,429 --> 01:06:15,683
"Maybe the stalker is
gaslighting Lee Chan."

885
01:06:17,101 --> 01:06:19,228
I'm reporting it.

886
01:06:21,314 --> 01:06:24,317
"That's not a stalker.
She's living the dream life."

887
01:06:24,734 --> 01:06:26,611
"She even landed a job."

888
01:06:27,820 --> 01:06:29,489
Is that a compliment
or a hate comment?

889
01:06:30,698 --> 01:06:32,033
- Hey. Let that slide.
- Let it slide?

890
01:06:32,116 --> 01:06:33,117
Yeah.

891
01:06:35,870 --> 01:06:39,332
"I actually saw the stalker fan.
She wasn't that pretty."

892
01:06:47,673 --> 01:06:49,550
<i>Delete that false information.</i>

893
01:06:50,093 --> 01:06:51,761
<i>She's pretty in person.</i>

894
01:06:56,766 --> 01:06:59,977
FOR

895
01:07:00,061 --> 01:07:01,687
FOR REAL

896
01:07:04,690 --> 01:07:06,526
<i>Delete the false information.</i>

897
01:07:06,776 --> 01:07:09,487
<i>She's pretty for real.</i>

898
01:07:11,406 --> 01:07:14,742
{\an8}<i>No matter how hard things get,
don't let go of my hand.</i>

899
01:07:15,952 --> 01:07:17,412
{\an8}This is crazy.

900
01:07:17,495 --> 01:07:19,080
{\an8}Secret office romance rules.

901
01:07:19,163 --> 01:07:20,206
{\an8}Da-reum.

902
01:07:21,040 --> 01:07:22,166
{\an8}No touching.

903
01:07:22,250 --> 01:07:23,793
{\an8}<i>You look happy.</i>

904
01:07:24,127 --> 01:07:25,586
{\an8}<i>Why Ha-gi and not me?</i>

905
01:07:26,921 --> 01:07:29,090
{\an8}It's the hottest topic
in fashion right now.

906
01:07:29,298 --> 01:07:31,426
{\an8}<i>The Creative Director's identity is
under wraps.</i>

907
01:07:31,509 --> 01:07:32,760
{\an8}Let's bring Han on board.

908
01:07:33,428 --> 01:07:34,929
{\an8}<i>She's on her way now.</i>

909
01:07:35,012 --> 01:07:36,305
{\an8}<i>Do you need my help?</i>

910
01:07:36,389 --> 01:07:38,391
{\an8}See if you can win Ha-gi's heart.

911
01:07:39,725 --> 01:07:42,311
{\an8}<i>Nice to meet you, Mr. Kang Ha-gi.</i>

912
01:07:45,334 --> 01:07:47,336
{\an8}Subtitles by Eunjin Erica Kim
and Jennifer Jean Lim

913
01:07:47,417 --> 01:07:49,419
{\an8}Synced and corrected by
WEISSACHsubs

